;
; How Burin files one path of a drawing in MYRA (burin_rules.h BR5): the
; path's number, how many points it holds, its stroke width in hundredths
; of a point and when the drawing was saved (Unix seconds). Burin asks
; whether the numbers fit before it lists them.
^ZXBURIN(path:i9) = points:i3! ^ stroke:i5! ^ mtime:i12!
